{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 纠缠熵标度律\n",
    "\n",
    "研究不同量子相的纠缠熵标度行为。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 学习目标\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 理解面积律\n",
    "2. 研究临界点对数发散\n",
    "3. 提取CFT中心电荷\n",
    "4. 分析有限尺寸效应"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from scipy.optimize import curve_fit\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "sys.path.append('../../common')\n",
    "\n",
    "%matplotlib inline"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 面积律 vs 体积律\n",
    "\n",
    "### 面积律（Area Law）\n",
    "基态: $S \\sim L^{d-1}$\n",
    "\n",
    "1D: $S \\sim$ const\n",
    "\n",
    "### 体积律（Volume Law）\n",
    "热态: $S \\sim L^d$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟不同相的纠缠熵\n",
    "positions = np.arange(1, 50)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 有序相（面积律）\n",
    "S_ordered = 0.6 * np.ones_like(positions, dtype=float) + 0.05 * np.random.randn(len(positions))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 临界点（对数）\n",
    "c = 0.5  # 伊辛CFT\n",
    "S_critical = (c / 6) * np.log(positions) + 0.3 + 0.05 * np.random.randn(len(positions))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 热态（体积律）\n",
    "S_thermal = 0.3 * positions + 0.1 * np.random.randn(len(positions))\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 线性标度\n",
    "axes[0].plot(positions, S_ordered, 'o-', label='Ordered (Area Law)', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[0].plot(positions, S_critical, 's-', label='Critical (Log)', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[0].plot(positions, S_thermal, '^-', label='Thermal (Volume)', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel('Position $i$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel('Entanglement Entropy $S(i)$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title('Entanglement Scaling (Linear)', fontsize=13)\n",
    "axes[0].legend()\n",
    "axes[0].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对数标度\n",
    "axes[1].plot(np.log(positions), S_ordered, 'o-', label='Ordered', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[1].plot(np.log(positions), S_critical, 's-', label='Critical', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel('$\\log(i)$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylabel('Entanglement Entropy $S(i)$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title('Entanglement Scaling (Log)', fontsize=13)\n",
    "axes[1].legend()\n",
    "axes[1].grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. CFT中心电荷提取\n",
    "\n",
    "临界点:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "S(l) = \\frac{c}{6} \\ln(l) + s_0\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",n",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# CFT拟合\n",
    "def cft_fit_function(x, c, s0):\n",
    "    return (c / 6) * np.log(x) + s0\n",
    "\n",
    "# 拟合中间50%的数据\n",
    "start = len(positions) // 4\n",
    "end = 3 * len(positions) // 4\n",
    "\n",
    "popt, pcov = curve_fit(cft_fit_function, positions[start:end], S_critical[start:end])\n",
    "c_fit, s0_fit = popt\n",
    "\n",
    "# 绘制拟合结果\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "plt.plot(positions, S_critical, 'o', label='Data', markersize=6, alpha=0.6)\n",
    "plt.plot(positions, cft_fit_function(positions, c_fit, s0_fit), '-', \n",
    "         linewidth=2, color='red', label=f'Fit: c = {c_fit:.4f}')\n",
    "plt.plot(positions, cft_fit_function(positions, c, s0_fit), '--',\n",
    "         linewidth=2, color='green', label=f'Theory: c = {c}')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Position $i$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Entanglement Entropy $S(i)$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.title('Central Charge Extraction', fontsize=14)\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"CFT分析结果:\")\n",
    "print(f\"拟合中心电荷: c = {c_fit:.6f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"理论值 (Ising): c = {c}\")\n",
    "print(f\"相对误差: {abs(c_fit - c) / c * 100:.2f}%\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n拟合常数: s₀ = {s0_fit:.6f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 有限尺寸修正\n",
    "\n",
    "有限系统 $L$:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "S(l) = \\frac{c}{6} \\ln\\left(\\frac{L}{\\pi} \\sin\\frac{\\pi l}{L}\\right) + s_0\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 有限尺寸效应\n",
    "L_values = [20, 40, 80, 160]\n",
    "colors = plt.cm.viridis(np.linspace(0, 1, len(L_values)))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(12, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "for L, color in zip(L_values, colors):\n",
    "    l = np.arange(1, L)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 有限尺寸公式\n",
    "    x_finite = (L / np.pi) * np.sin(np.pi * l / L)\n",
    "    S_finite = (c / 6) * np.log(x_finite) + s0_fit\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.plot(l / L, S_finite, 'o-', color=color, label=f'L = {L}', \n",
    "            markersize=4, alpha=0.7)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Scaled Position $i/L$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Entanglement Entropy', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.title('Finite Size Scaling', fontsize=14)\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"有限尺寸标度:\")\n",
    "print(\"所有曲线在标度坐标下塌缩到同一曲线\")\n",
    "print(\"这是共形不变性的体现！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 不同CFT的中心电荷"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 不同理论的中心电荷\n",
    "cft_theories = {\n",
    "    'Free Boson': 1.0,\n",
    "    'Ising': 0.5,\n",
    "    'Tricritical Ising': 0.7,\n",
    "    '3-state Potts': 0.8,\n",
    "    'Free Fermion': 0.5,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "positions_cft = np.arange(2, 60)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "for name, c_theory in cft_theories.items():\n",
    "    S = (c_theory / 6) * np.log(positions_cft)\n",
    "    ax1.plot(positions_cft, S, '-', linewidth=2, label=f'{name} (c={c_theory})')\n",
    "\n",
    "ax1.set_xlabel('Position', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax1.set_ylabel('Entanglement Entropy', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax1.set_title('Different CFTs', fontsize=13)\n",
    "ax1.legend()\n",
    "ax1.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 中心电荷分布\n",
    "c_values = list(cft_theories.values())\n",
    "names = list(cft_theories.keys())\n",
    "\n",
    "ax2.barh(names, c_values, color='steelblue', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "ax2.set_xlabel('Central Charge $c$', fontsize=12)\n",
    "ax2.set_title('Central Charges', fontsize=13)\n",
    "ax2.grid(True, alpha=0.3, axis='x')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 练习\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 验证不同系统尺寸的标度塌缩\n",
    "2. 研究周期边界vs开放边界\n",
    "3. 计算角动量分辨纠缠谱\n",
    "4. 分析有能隙相的指数衰减\n",
    "\n",
    "## 扩展阅读\n",
    "\n",
    "- Calabrese & Cardy (2004) - CFT与纠缠熵\n",
    "- Holzhey et al. (1994) - 黑洞熵类比\n",
    "- Vidal et al. (2003) - 临界系统的纠缠"
   ]
  }
